WEBVTT

00:17:59.038 --> 00:18:04.663
Whatever algorithm or process led
you to that, undo it. Yeah.

00:18:04.663 --> 00:18:09.621
And that the system is that incredibly
powerful at avoiding that same kind of

00:18:09.621 --> 00:18:13.038
mistake in future because it sort
of replicates the instructions

00:18:13.788 --> 00:18:14.038
, correct? Yeah.

00:18:14.329 --> 00:18:16.579
And eventually and not much longer,

00:18:16.579 --> 00:18:19.788
I believe that we'll be able to not only
say that was good, that was bad,

00:18:19.996 --> 00:18:22.121
but say that was bad for this reason.

00:18:22.621 --> 00:18:26.329
And also tell me how you got to that
answer so I can make sure I understand.

00:18:27.371 --> 00:18:28.371
But at the end of the day,

00:18:28.371 --> 00:18:31.871
someone needs to decide
who is the wise human